caption: Wild Branch Manifestation
tradition-component: wild-branch-manifestation

While expressing a Revelation, a Revelator whose Psi-origin Wild Talent has Wild Ability may use it to temporarily manifest an otherwise legal Advanced Psi ability belonging solely to either one of the two Revelator Powers.

This use follows the normal Wild Talent and Wild Ability rules, limits, costs, and duration. It is not an Eldritch Gift Power Stunt and does not create permanent purchase permission. The character is temporarily expressing one branch separately rather than stabilizing it. If the character does not currently possess Wild Ability on the relevant Wild Talent, this permission has no effect.
